consistent name. The synthetic example reports three observations, without claiming empirical validation.\n\n翻译此处\n尚未翻译\nFigure 1 A synthetic overview without external image dependencies.\n翻译此处\n尚未翻译\n\n此处暂无法预览\n\nTable 1 Synthetic scores.\n\nMethod\tScore\nAdaptive estimator\t3\n\nA documented limitation is retained for inspection rather than silently corrected.\n\n翻译此处\n尚未翻译\nA Additional details\n翻译此处\n尚未翻译\n\nThe appendix reuses s for a size, a deliberate scope-sensitive example. UTF-8 evidence includes naïve, café, 中文 and an astral character 🧪. CRLF source: café 中文 🧪. A second CRLF line retains Unicode character offsets.\n\n翻译此处\n尚未翻译\n\n此处暂无法预览\n\n参考文献\nknown2026\n预览诊断 · 7"
